<title>UK: Novorossiisk oil port shut due to high winds, swell.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk oil port shut due to high winds, swell.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Black Sea oil port of Novorossiisk was closed on Thursday morning due to very high winds and heavy swell, a shipping source said.</p>
<p>The port was closed at 0850 p.m.(local time) on Wednesday because of a force 7 gale.</p>
<p>&quot;With winds like that we're not expecting to see anything open today,&quot; said the source.</p>
<p>The other Black Sea oil ports and the Baltic port of Ventspils were all reported open.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
